		` C ` + fnum(subjX-w*0.42) + ` ` + fnum(subjY+h*0.42) + ` ` + fnum(subjX-w*0.55) + ` ` + fnum(subjY-h*0.15) + ` ` + fnum(subjX) + ` ` + fnum(subjY-h*0.55) + ` Z`
